0_AfvIeVAXwNYNoHs8y3Zib_rUn7TkItJYIjzEzCkYO2kj3Q&oe=69A6CDA9"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "UPGRADE_VideoCover.png", "id": "456245369483804", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035406_456245376150470_4810981854464787811_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vrvXOncNllUQ7kNvwHyjSa1&_nc_oc=Adk9bHPW9qR4tDiI-k5CliBCfLgt219YJ4cJ0873QK2ChZzSZlb5SI2ldRaNv300UTc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afsk7IA-ExCtBDuUCHJ_HpaO_vlDD4uaz9DEEldWi4a70A&oe=69A6C61E"}, "display_name": "Upgrade VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Developed by neuropsychologists, UPGRADE VR is a fun, simple training routine that helps you test and hone your brain\u2019s cognitive skills.\n\nExercise with UPGRADE VR every day to improve your cognitive skills, such as:\n\n- memory\n- concentration and attention span\n- reaction\n- eye-hand coordination\n- stress tolerance\n\nOur entertaining and engaging workout only takes 10\u202615 minutes a day. Training feels like playing a game!\n\nTrack your progress in our mobile app UPGRADE VR where  you can review your achievements, read interesting news about brain-related research and the latest discoveries in neuropsychology.\n\nNote that cognitive training could be a useful addition to comprehensive COVID-19 recovery regimen.\n\nUPGRADE your brain now!\n", "short_description": "Developed by neuropsychologists, UPGRADE VR is a fun, simple training routine that helps you test and hone your brain\u2019s cognitive skills.\nThis cognitive VR-training could be a useful addition to comprehensive COVID-19 recovery regimen.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vr-upgrade.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "UPGRADE VR \u2013 FZCO", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vr-upgrade.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"